WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.766
Open the Replace dialog with Control+H.

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:06.304
Type the word "colour" into the Find field.

00:00:06.704 --> 00:00:10.177
Type the word "color" into the Replace with field.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:13.904
Click Replace All to replace every occurrence.

00:00:14.304 --> 00:00:16.228
Close the Replace dialog.

00:00:16.628 --> 00:00:18.861
Save the file with Control+S.

